<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Flørli 4444 and Rallarstien — Flørli 4,444 steps–Rallarstien complete circuit</name><desc>Start by Flørli quay at the foot of the staircase, climb all 4,444 wooden steps, cross the Ternevatnet dam and descend the historic Rallarstien. Cross the scree, construction-road junction and Flørliåa bridges, pass Flørlistølen and return along the village path to the staircase foot.

